{"transcript":"kəˈprɪʃəsli","exists":true,"definitions":["In a way that is subject to sudden, unpredictable changes of mood or behavior.","In an arbitrary or whimsical manner."],"examples":["The weather changed capriciously.","He acted capriciously without reason.","The rules were applied capriciously."],"lemma":"capricious","lemmaPos":"adjective","synonyms":["whimsically","fickly","erratically","unpredictably"],"number":"singular","source":"capriciously"}